=== Host and judges ===
[[Tom Bergeron]] and [[Brooke Burke Charvet]] returned as hosts, while [[Carrie Ann Inaba]], [[Len Goodman]], and [[Bruno Tonioli]] returned as judges. The [[Harold Wheeler (musician)|Harold Wheeler]] orchestra and singers provided music throughout the season.

