===Week 7: Dance Fusion Week===
Each couple performed a fusion dance of two previously learned dance styles, followed by a [[Swing (dance)|swing dance]] marathon.<ref name="autogenerated1">Mentioned by Tom Bergeron on October 29 performance show.</ref> Due to the presidential election and the effects of [[Hurricane Sandy]] for East Coast viewers, no elimination took place. [[Mark Ballas]] performed with [[Shawn Johnson]] this week, because [[Derek Hough]] was out with an injury.<ref>{{cite web |author=Gina Carbone |url=http://www.wetpaint.com/dancing-with-the-stars/articles/injury-forces-derek-hough-to-step-out-next-week-on-dwts-all-stars-mark-ballas-to-step-in |title=Injury Forces Derek Hough to "Step Out" Next Week on DWTS All-Stars, Mark Ballas to Step In &#124; Dancing With The Stars |publisher=Wetpaint |date=2012-10-30 |access-date=2015-02-16 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20150216122145/http://www.wetpaint.com/dancing-with-the-stars/articles/injury-forces-derek-hough-to-step-out-next-week-on-dwts-all-stars-mark-ballas-to-step-in |archive-date=2015-02-16 |url-status=live }}</ref> Couples are listed in the order they performed.

